          "id": "631971e2f2fe240a4043ae4d",
          "questionText": "What does Mr. Heckbert suggest about one of the items he ordered?",
          "image": "",
          "sound": "",
          "options": [
            "(A) He was overcharged for it.",
            "(B) He cannot fit in it.",
            "(C) He bought it on sale.",
            "(D) He purchased it for his wife."
          ],
          "correctOptions": [
            "(D) He purchased it for his wife."
          ],
          "transcript": "<p>Look at the invoice, we can see the clothing for women is <em>\"Women’s Green Blouse (S)\"</em>.<em>&nbsp;</em>Meanwhile, in the second passage, there is information <em>\"<strong>my wife </strong>and I are both pleased with how they fit.\"&nbsp;</em>=&gt; It can be inferred that&nbsp;Mr. Heckbert&nbsp;purchased this item for his wife.&nbsp;=&gt; D is correct&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "explanationVi": "<p data-end=\"302\" data-start=\"0\">Nh&igrave;n v&agrave;o <strong data-end=\"20\" data-start=\"9\">h&oacute;a đơn</strong>, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể thấy mặt h&agrave;ng quần &aacute;o d&agrave;nh cho nữ l&agrave; <strong data-end=\"142\" data-start=\"75\">&ldquo;Women&rsquo;s Green Blouse (S)&rdquo;</strong>. Trong khi đ&oacute;, ở <strong data-end=\"180\" data-start=\"160\">đoạn văn thứ hai</strong>, c&oacute; th&ocirc;ng tin: <em data-end=\"249\" data-start=\"196\">&ldquo;my wife and I are both pleased with how they fit.&rdquo;</em>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"408\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"304\">&rArr; Từ đ&oacute; c&oacute; thể <strong data-end=\"381\" data-start=\"319\">suy ra rằng &ocirc;ng Heckbert đ&atilde; mua m&oacute;n đồ n&agrave;y cho vợ của m&igrave;nh</strong>.<br data-end=\"385\" data-start=\"382\" />\n&rArr; <strong data-end=\"408\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"387\">Đ&aacute;p &aacute;n D l&agrave; đ&uacute;ng.</strong></p>\n"
        },
        {
          "id": "631971e2f2fe240a4043ae4e",
          "questionText": "<p>How much money would Mr. Heckbert like back?</p>",
          "image": "",
          "sound": "",
          "options": [
            "<p>(A) $15.00</p>",
            "<p>(B) $14.69</p>",
            "<p>(C) $22.00</p>",
            "<p>(D) $27.20</p>"
          ],
          "correctOptions": [
            "<p>(D) $27.20</p>"
          ],
          "transcript": "<p>In the second passage, it says that <em>\"The problem, however, concerns the amount of money I was charged for the items I bought, while the invoice I received with the items noted that I was given a 10% discount, when I received my credit card bill, I noticed that the discount had actually not been applied.\" </em>Look at the invoice, we can see that the discount is $27.20.&nbsp;=&gt;&nbsp;Mr. Heckbert would like to receive back $27.20.&nbsp;=&gt; D is correct&nbsp;</p>",
          "explanationVi": "<p>Trong đoạn thứ hai, nó nói rằng \"<em>\"The problem, however, concerns the amount of money I was charged for the items I bought, while the invoice I received with the items noted that I was given a 10% discount, when I received my credit card bill, I noticed that the discount had actually not been applied.\"</em></p>\n<p><strong>Tạm dịch:</strong> \"Tuy nhiên, vấn đề liên quan đến số tiền tôi phải trả cho những món hàng tôi đã mua, trong khi hóa đơn tôi nhận được kèm theo những món hàng đó ghi rằng tôi đã được giảm giá 10% khi tôi nhận được hàng.\" hóa đơn thẻ tín dụng, tôi nhận thấy rằng khoản giảm giá thực tế chưa được áp dụng.\" Nhìn vào hóa đơn, chúng ta có thể thấy mức giảm giá là 27,20 USD. =&gt; Ông Heckbert muốn nhận lại $27,20. <strong>=&gt; D đúng</strong></p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "631971e2f2fe240a4043ae4f",
          "questionText": "<p>What does Mr. Heckbert send with his e-mail?</p>",
          "image": "",
          "sound": "",
          "options": [
            "(A) A new clothing order",
            "(B) A copy of his bill",
            "(C) A picture of the faulty merchandise",
            "(D) A file containing his credit card bill"
