          "transcript": "<p>(A) certify:&nbsp;to state officially, especially in writing, that something is true</p>\n\n<p>(B) refute:&nbsp;to prove that something is wrong</p>\n\n<p>(C) purchase:&nbsp;to buy something</p>\n\n<p>(D) admit:&nbsp;to agree, often unwillingly, that something is true</p>\n\n<p>Based on the meaning <strong>=&gt; Choose A</strong></p>\n",
